# MASTER APPLICATION BUILD PROMPT
## MS Appliances – Extended Warranty (EW) Quotation Management System

### 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, production-ready internal web application for **MS Appliances** to manage Extended Warranty (EW) quotations for Sales Representatives.

The application will allow authorized employees to create EW quotations using Sales Order (SO) information, identify eligible products, validate the 180-day eligibility period, retrieve EW package pricing, determine the applicable sales tax, compare available warranty packages, calculate the final customer price, and save and manage quotations.

The system must support two ways of entering Sales Order information:

1. **Upload Sales Order:** Sales Representatives can upload an SO document so the system can extract the information automatically using Gemini multimodal document processing.
2. **Manual Entry:** Sales Representatives can enter all required information directly into the form without uploading a document.

Uploading an SO is optional. It is strictly an information-extraction convenience feature. The original SO document must not be permanently stored or attached to the quotation.

The application must be designed as an actual operational business system, not a static prototype or demonstration.

Do not use dummy data, fabricated warranty prices, invented tax rates, or placeholder calculations in production functionality.

