# 23. VALIDATION AND ERROR HANDLING

Build comprehensive validation throughout the application.

Examples:

- Missing SO Number: Prevent saving.
- Missing Customer Name: Prevent saving.
- Missing Customer Phone: Prevent saving.
- Missing Shipping Address: Prevent saving.
- Missing Ship Date: Require review and prevent normal calculation.
- Future Ship Date: Require review.
- More than 180 days: Mark ineligible.
- No qualifying products: Prevent EW calculation.
- Uncertain product classification: Require review.
- Missing package pricing: Do not fabricate a price.
- No tax jurisdiction match: Require review.
- Multiple conflicting tax matches: Require review.
- Missing tax exemption document: Do not allow submission as a valid exemption request.
- Pending tax exemption: Clearly display pending status.
- Rejected tax exemption: Restore standard applicable tax.
- Duplicate SO quotation: Open existing quotation or offer authorized version creation.
- Failed Google Sheets sync: Display failure and stale reference warning.
- Failed document extraction: Allow manual entry.
- Failed quotation save: Preserve the form contents and show an error.
- Unauthorized action: Deny the action and record it where appropriate.

Provide actionable error messages that explain what needs to be corrected.

